{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107419","id":2585116033,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6aFb2B","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107419","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107419.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107419.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107419","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107419/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107419/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107419/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8804c88443c31bfc4bb8ba132a4b039d10a9261b","number":107419,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Change all interpolators to FP32 in mobile renderer.","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107412.\r\n\r\nThe true reason behind being unable to use FP16 interpolators was not that Adreno has a bug, but rather, it's just outright not supported. Apparently, support for interpolators on FP16 is a different capability altogether that must be checked.\r\n\r\nhttps://registry.khronos.org/vulkan/specs/latest/man/html/VkPhysicalDevice16BitStorageFeatures.html\r\n\r\n> storageInputOutput16 specifies whether objects in the Input and Output storage classes can have 16-bit integer and 16-bit floating-point members. If this feature is not enabled, 16-bit integer or 16-bit floating-point members must not be used in such objects. This also specifies whether shader modules can declare the StorageInputOutput16 capability.\r\n\r\nThis PR immediately fixes the issue. We can evaluate further improvements by bringing back `mediump` specifically in a different PR later.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://av